{"is_source_file": true, "format": "Python", "description": "This file is an initialization module (__init__.py) for the 'Detection.Custom' package of the ImageAI library. It contains classes and functions for training custom object detection models (like YOLOv3) and for performing object detection on images and videos using pre-trained models. The code defines a training class 'DetectionModelTrainer', detection classes for images and videos, and utility classes for handling model inference, decoding network output, and Non-Maximum Suppression (NMS). It references several external modules such as TensorFlow, OpenCV (cv2), and internal modules for data parsing, anchor generation, callbacks, and model architectures.", "external_files": ["imageai.Detection.Custom.voc", "imageai.Detection.YOLO.yolov3", "imageai.Detection.Custom.generator", "imageai.Detection.Custom.utils.utils", "imageai.Detection.Custom.callbacks", "imageai.Detection.Custom.utils.multi_gpu_model", "imageai.Detection.Custom.gen_anchors", "tensorflow.keras.callbacks", "tensorflow.keras.optimizers", "tensorflow.keras.models", "tensorflow.keras", "cv2", "numpy"], "external_methods": ["parse_voc_annotation", "yolov3_main", "yolov3_train", "dummy_loss", "BatchGenerator", "normalize", "evaluate", "makedirs", "generateAnchors", "load_model", "cv2.rectangle", "cv2.putText"], "published": ["DetectionModelTrainer", "CustomObjectDetection", "CustomVideoObjectDetection", "BoundBox", "CustomDetectionUtils"], "classes": [{"name": "DetectionModelTrainer", "description": "Class for training custom object detection models, particularly YOLOv3, on Pascal VOC formatted datasets. Manages data setup, model training, evaluation, and saving configurations."}, {"name": "CustomObjectDetection", "description": "Class for performing object detection on images using a custom-trained YOLOv3 model. Handles model loading, image detection, and visualization."}, {"name": "CustomVideoObjectDetection", "description": "Class for detecting